 .../VideoShaders/YUV2RGBShaderGLES.cpp        |  42 ++-
 .../VideoShaders/YUV2RGBShaderGLES.h          |  29 +-
 xbmc/settings/AdvancedSettings.cpp            |   2 +
 xbmc/settings/AdvancedSettings.h              |   6 +
